// Render pix (f_tf_smooth): passthrough. The state pix owns the feedback
// computation; this node only surfaces its output to the module outlet and
// the visible draw, the two-domain f_vf_advect wiring (plan ADR-2). Kept as
// a separate gen file (not folded into the state codebox) because the state
// pix's outlet also feeds the feedback loop; separating "compute" from
// "present" keeps the outlet independent of the feedback node's own timing,
// same shape as f_vf_advect's pass/state pair. No params, no clamps, no
// decode -- the raw tensor passes through untouched.
out1 = sample(in1, norm);   // inline access (stored-variable .x silent-fails)